sequenceDiagram
  %% Source for 25-search-tool-call-flow.html. Edit this file, then run ./scripts/render-diagrams.py.
  %% Directives: docs in diagrams/README.md (Updating diagrams).
  %% @subtitle The user only writes a prompt; the model decides to search, and because web search interception is off, the agent runs searxng-search and asks the model again
  %% @type frontend: APP
  %% @type cloud: TR
  %% @type security: PR
  %% @type external: OAI ENG
  %% @type database: OBS
  actor U as User
  participant APP as Agent or chat app<br/>owns the tool loop
  participant TR as Traefik<br/>TLS + edge limits
  participant LL as LiteLLM proxy<br/>auth · policy · search tools
  participant PR as Presidio<br/>PII masking
  participant OAI as OpenAI<br/>provider model
  participant SX as SearXNG<br/>internal network only
  participant ENG as Search engines<br/>SearXNG defaults
  participant OBS as Telemetry<br/>spend · metrics · spans

  U->>APP: prompt: what changed in the latest LiteLLM release?
  Note over APP: the app, not the user, defines a web_search function tool
  APP->>TR: POST /v1/chat/completions: prompt + tool
  TR->>LL: route by host
  LL->>PR: pre_call: mask PII in the prompt
  PR-->>LL: masked prompt
  LL->>OAI: prompt + tool definition
  Note over OAI: the model decides it needs a search and writes the query from the prompt
  OAI-->>LL: tool_call: web_search(query)
  LL->>PR: post_call: mask PII in the output
  PR-->>LL: masked output
  LL-)OBS: spend log, metrics, content-free span
  LL-->>APP: tool_calls through Traefik
  Note over APP,LL: LiteLLM does not run the search for the model; the app executes the tool call
  APP->>TR: POST /v1/search/searxng-search {query}
  TR->>LL: route by host
  alt key invalid or search tool not permitted
    LL--xAPP: 401 / 403 through Traefik
  else authorized
    Note over LL: Presidio does not mask search queries
    LL->>SX: GET /search?q=…&format=json
    SX->>ENG: query each enabled engine
    ENG-->>SX: result pages
    SX-->>LL: JSON results
    LL-)OBS: spend log, metrics, span
    LL-->>APP: results through Traefik
  end
  APP->>TR: POST /v1/chat/completions: prompt + tool call + results
  TR->>LL: route by host
  LL->>PR: pre_call: mask PII, including the results
  PR-->>LL: masked messages
  LL->>OAI: call the model
  OAI-->>LL: final answer
  LL->>PR: post_call: mask PII in the answer
  PR-->>LL: masked answer
  LL-)OBS: spend log, metrics, content-free span
  LL-->>TR: response
  TR-->>APP: response
  APP-->>U: answer with sources
